). That made the `test_half_even` test fail: `2.665` rounded to `2.67` instead of `2.66`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That's the only change.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** #101 (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101). When the PR was created it came back with no reviewers, so I added alex separately and he's now listed.\n\nThe PR still needs a code owner's approval before it can be merged; I haven't merged it. I also tried to look up FIN-212 in the advisory tool, but it isn't there, so this fix relies only on the test and the docstring.", "type": "text"}]}]}